<h3>How this is estimated</h3>

The estimate uses a MET (metabolic equivalent) value for your chosen
intensity, scaled by your body weight and the duration of the session.

<h3>Why estimates vary</h3>

Actual energy expenditure depends on technique, rest intervals, fitness
level and body composition. Treat the figure as a guide.
